"text": "Your beige hoodie with the pink hood looks soft and perfect for autumn days. The wide, light-blue jeans are roomy and comfortable but still keep a neat line at your waist. Your beige plimsolls add a relaxed touch to a work day, while your patterned bag brings a lively detail that makes the whole look interesting.",
"how_to_wear": "If you need more warmth, slip the hoodie on over a light layer; take it off for meetings or breaks. If you want to highlight your waist, tuck the front of your top slightly into your jeans or leave them loose and let the wide cut draw the eye down to your legs. Wear your bag across your body when you move between spaces and slip it over one shoulder if you stay in one room.",
