{
"n": "#204·06",
"text": "These light-blue wide-leg jeans have a relaxed cut that flows from the waist to your ankles. The fabric is soft and shows gentle distressing at the knees, keeping them casual but neat enough for an office day."
},
{
"n": "#40·35",
"text": "Your beige hooded top features long sleeves with a pink hood that adds a soft accent. It is worn open as a layer, letting you adjust your warmth throughout the day without losing its clean shape."
},
{
"n": "#17·02",
"text": "Your beige plimsolls have a textured suede look and a low profile that keeps your stance grounded yet light. They fit comfortably with wide jeans and match your outfit's relaxed tone."
},
{
"n": "#150·37",
"text": "This bag has a woven pattern in earthy tones and a black base, carrying a modern feel. Its cross-body strap lets you move freely from desk to door."
}
